    narr:narration """The trajectory of this hub centers on the [core feature of decision capture](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture), defined as the primary product differentiator by anchoring artifacts to the moment of consensus. This conceptual framework was operationalized in August 2026, when the team reported the successful [shipment of the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786181689174_1). Evidence of this feature's efficacy is framed through [sprint retrospective data](narr:Position_SprintRetroDeliveryEvidence), which correlates the release with a [peak in team velocity](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786181689174_2). The narrative connects these technical milestones to the broader product strategy, identifying the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786181689174_3) as the critical unlock for the current delivery cycle.""" ;
